{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Better Mart Simulator \u2013 Build and Manage Your Dream Supermarket!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Better Mart Simulator</strong>, an immersive management game playable in first and third person, where every decision counts. Design your <strong>supermarket</strong> down to the smallest detail, attract crowds of customers, and transform a simple store into a <strong>retail empire</strong>.<br>With total freedom, rewarding progression, and ultra-addictive gameplay, your success is limited only by your business acumen! <br>A rich, dynamic, and incredibly satisfying management experience. In <strong>Better Mart Simulator</strong>, you control absolutely everything. <br>Decide on the layout of the aisles, organize the arrangement of products, and optimize every corner of your supermarket to boost your sales. <br>Manage inventory, monitor prices, analyze the competition, and grow your business day after day.<br>Every choice impacts your success. <strong>Can you become the ultimate CEO?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/21ead9e48b2f5da5cfb71ee0082f2225.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/21ead9e48b2f5da5cfb71ee0082f2225.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/21ead9e48b2f5da5cfb71ee0082f2225.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you in Better Mart Simulator:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Build and customize your supermarket<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/1415ee2f4224c2855a5bfda8b4584f41.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/1415ee2f4224c2855a5bfda8b4584f41.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/1415ee2f4224c2855a5bfda8b4584f41.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange the shelves, decorate, furnish, and create a unique place where customers will love to shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Manages procurement and inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/f2524f4fdd2471525c7b8c8eae7c42f9.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/f2524f4fdd2471525c7b8c8eae7c42f9.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/f2524f4fdd2471525c7b8c8eae7c42f9.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor inventory levels, anticipate shortages, order products, and adjust your prices according to market trends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Keep your store spotless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/06b68e097a0fb56068099400a02193d2.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/06b68e097a0fb56068099400a02193d2.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/06b68e097a0fb56068099400a02193d2.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the aisles, repair your machines, and monitor overall satisfaction to maintain your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Receive your deliveries by truck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/aa87f844b3cb98c0b2977b9a620ec0d1.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/aa87f844b3cb98c0b2977b9a620ec0d1.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/aa87f844b3cb98c0b2977b9a620ec0d1.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload pallets, operate the pallet truck and stacker to fill your stockrooms and restock your shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Grow your business</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bac9605ecfeaf7b79cd9aa2651a057ae.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bac9605ecfeaf7b79cd9aa2651a057ae.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bac9605ecfeaf7b79cd9aa2651a057ae.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, train, and supervise your employees. Improve their skills and invest in increasingly high-performance equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Multiplayer for up to 6 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bf68241d2c773d88c0cdc63a7e88d440.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bf68241d2c773d88c0cdc63a7e88d440.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bf68241d2c773d88c0cdc63a7e88d440.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your supermarket with others! Work together to optimize tasks, divide up roles, grow your business faster, or try to prove who is the best manager. A fun, chaotic, and unique cooperative experience in the world of management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Provide an impeccable customer experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze visitor behavior, optimize their journey, solve their problems, and avoid complaints that could damage your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Unlock new specialty sectionsBakery, butcher shop, wine cellar, jewelry store, appliances, fruits and vegetables, fresh &amp; frozen foods. Diversify your offerings and attract new customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Grow your empire Start small and become a leader with a thriving supermarket chain ready to dominate the market.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to create the perfect supermarket?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the demo and discover management like you've never experienced it before.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Better Mart!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/14c6dd3a2197d92957d9494966929ebe8571bff6.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/41f65c7b1544cd57206e1c774638dd02517fa120.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/f06014bd6e692a75234e90a7a8cd978d574ad288.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/8a764ccf21db3e066d9e1ee667e174e986ad6f6a.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/33bb08c90f43255ca6043c56fba73afd688a9180.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/18ecf30318f30eca2d88ce79309f0eaa1d858ebd.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/ffdaff368252d5c22bfacb169c7b024ac33de88b.jpg"},{"name":"Items Sell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/620559eeaae0e22c718d0cc1606d71f849aec690.jpg"},{"name":"Place an order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/2ca82e1134f9e26da2c1399e37b39b823142a1de.jpg"},{"name":"Place an order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498270/dfb7a69cfe595a59ddb160470f7b4df74e08a5eb.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498270?t=1773748877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773748877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/cd21daeac10f7caa6a10212f83b787681cb021cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773748877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/cd21daeac10f7caa6a10212f83b787681cb021cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773748877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3635120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>EARLY ACCESS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/74fbbe3e0cd48d16b2411a1503786f49.avif?t=1773748877\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Better Mart Simulator \u2013 Build and Manage Your Dream Supermarket!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Better Mart Simulator</strong>, an immersive management game playable in first and third person, where every decision counts. Design your <strong>supermarket</strong> down to the smallest detail, attract crowds of customers, and transform a simple store into a <strong>retail empire</strong>.<br>With total freedom, rewarding progression, and ultra-addictive gameplay, your success is limited only by your business acumen! <br>A rich, dynamic, and incredibly satisfying management experience. In <strong>Better Mart Simulator</strong>, you control absolutely everything. <br>Decide on the layout of the aisles, organize the arrangement of products, and optimize every corner of your supermarket to boost your sales. <br>Manage inventory, monitor prices, analyze the competition, and grow your business day after day.<br>Every choice impacts your success. <strong>Can you become the ultimate CEO?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/21ead9e48b2f5da5cfb71ee0082f2225.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/21ead9e48b2f5da5cfb71ee0082f2225.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/21ead9e48b2f5da5cfb71ee0082f2225.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you in Better Mart Simulator:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Build and customize your supermarket<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/1415ee2f4224c2855a5bfda8b4584f41.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/1415ee2f4224c2855a5bfda8b4584f41.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/1415ee2f4224c2855a5bfda8b4584f41.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange the shelves, decorate, furnish, and create a unique place where customers will love to shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Manages procurement and inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/f2524f4fdd2471525c7b8c8eae7c42f9.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/f2524f4fdd2471525c7b8c8eae7c42f9.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/f2524f4fdd2471525c7b8c8eae7c42f9.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor inventory levels, anticipate shortages, order products, and adjust your prices according to market trends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Keep your store spotless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/06b68e097a0fb56068099400a02193d2.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/06b68e097a0fb56068099400a02193d2.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/06b68e097a0fb56068099400a02193d2.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the aisles, repair your machines, and monitor overall satisfaction to maintain your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Receive your deliveries by truck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/aa87f844b3cb98c0b2977b9a620ec0d1.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/aa87f844b3cb98c0b2977b9a620ec0d1.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/aa87f844b3cb98c0b2977b9a620ec0d1.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload pallets, operate the pallet truck and stacker to fill your stockrooms and restock your shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Grow your business</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bac9605ecfeaf7b79cd9aa2651a057ae.poster.avif?t=1773748877\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bac9605ecfeaf7b79cd9aa2651a057ae.webm?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bac9605ecfeaf7b79cd9aa2651a057ae.mp4?t=1773748877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, train, and supervise your employees. Improve their skills and invest in increasingly high-performance equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Multiplayer for up to 6 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/bf68241d2c773d88c0cdc63a7e88d440.poster.avif?t=17737488